<title>GERMANY: Hijack at Cologne airport is over - German police.</title>
<headline>Hijack at Cologne airport is over - German police.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two men who hijacked a Boeing 737 Air Malta airliner to Germany on a flight to Istanbul early on Monday have given themselves up, German police said.  </p>
<p>&quot;The assailants have given themselves up,&quot; police spokesman Werner Schmidt told reporters at Cologne-Bonn airport in western Germany.</p>
<p>He said the two men had come off the plane with their hands in the air.</p>
</text>
